  "content": "#### Epilogue: The Rising Tide\nThree weeks later, the corporate cartels are crumbling under mass strikes, military mutinies, and civilian revolts. The ARC serves as the humanitarian command hub of a free society. Dyson, freed from the fallen prison, arrives at the redoubt and embraces Lucas. Standing in the morning sunlight on the mountain, Lucas looks out over a free horizon—knowing humanity will never be forced underground again.",
